A '''Nylocas''' can be seen in a cutscene during [[A Night at the Theatre]]. It is revealed through a memory that [[Verzik Vitur]] attempted to create a very powerful Nylocas through a breeding program. By cross-breeding a nylocas from her homeworld [[Vampyrium]] with a [[Gielinor]]ian [[araxyte]], Verzik created this new variant which she calls the Queen Nylocas.

The Queen Nylocas however was very small, with [[Ranis Drakan]] expressing disappointment at the outcome. While showing the Nylocas to Ranis, it bites Verzik and quickly dies. Although they both thought the experiment was a failure, this in reality infected Verzik, causing her to gain excess weight and fall ill, eventually resulting in her death as the powerful [[Nylocas Queen]] bursts forth from her body.

